#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/autoscaling/predictive-autoscaling.rst:5
msgid "Predictive Autoscaling"
msgstr "预测性自动扩缩容"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/autoscaling/predictive-autoscaling.rst:7
msgid "Reactive autoscaling waits for the metric to move before it adds replicas, which costs at least one pod start-up time of headroom. Predictive autoscaling closes part of that gap: it projects the metric trend of the observation window forward and, in ``Auto`` mode, uses the projection as a floor for scale-up. The reactive decision is never replaced, and a projection never scales a workload down."
msgstr "响应式自动扩缩容会等到指标发生变化后才增加副本，因此至少需要预留一个 Pod 启动时间的余量。预测性自动扩缩容可缩小部分差距：它根据观测窗口内的指标趋势向前预测，并在 ``Auto`` 模式下将预测结果作为扩容下限。响应式决策始终保留，预测结果也绝不会缩减工作负载。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/autoscaling/predictive-autoscaling.rst:13
msgid "The feature is opt-in through ``spec.predictive``. When the block is absent nothing in this page applies. Today the block is accepted and validated only: applying it writes no ``status.predictive`` and changes no replica count. The controller that consumes these fields lands in a follow-up."
msgstr "此功能通过 ``spec.predictive`` 显式启用。未配置该字段块时，本页内容均不适用。目前该字段块仅会被接受和校验：应用后不会写入 ``status.predictive``，也不会更改副本数。使用这些字段的控制器将在后续版本中提供。"

