#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/autoscaling/predictive-autoscaling.rst:28
msgid "The controller computes the projection and records it in ``status.predictive``, but the replica decision stays exactly as it is without the block. Use it to watch what the projection would have asked for before trusting it. This is the default when ``mode`` is omitted."
msgstr "控制器会计算预测结果并将其记录在 ``status.predictive`` 中，但副本决策与未配置该字段块时完全相同。可先通过此模式观察预测结果会请求多少副本，再决定是否采用。这是省略 ``mode`` 时的默认模式。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/autoscaling/predictive-autoscaling.rst:32
msgid "``Auto``"
msgstr "``Auto``"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/autoscaling/predictive-autoscaling.rst:33
msgid "The projection is converted into a replica count and used as a floor: ``final = max(reactive, projected)``. It can raise a scale-up, never trigger or lower a scale-down."
msgstr "预测结果会转换为副本数并作为下限：``final = max(reactive, projected)``。它可以提高扩容幅度，但绝不会触发缩容或降低缩容后的副本数。"

