#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/autoscaling/predictive-autoscaling.rst:70
msgid "Replica count the same round would apply in ``Auto``, after the same caps, bounds and cooldown. In ``Auto`` it equals the applied count; in ``Preview`` it shows whether ``Auto`` would change the decision."
msgstr "同一轮在 ``Auto`` 模式下经过相同的上限、边界和冷却处理后将应用的副本数。在 ``Auto`` 模式下，它等于实际应用的副本数；在 ``Preview`` 模式下，它用于显示 ``Auto`` 是否会改变决策。"

