msgstr "限制"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/autoscaling/predictive-autoscaling.rst:87
msgid "Predictive scaling is not supported with ``scalingStrategy: HPA``. The HPA strategy delegates the decision to a native ``HorizontalPodAutoscaler`` resource, which has no channel to receive the projection, so the combination is rejected by the validating webhook."
msgstr "预测性扩缩容不支持与 ``scalingStrategy: HPA`` 搭配使用。HPA 策略将决策委托给原生 ``HorizontalPodAutoscaler`` 资源，而该资源没有接收预测结果的通道，因此校验 Webhook 会拒绝这种组合。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/autoscaling/predictive-autoscaling.rst:90
msgid "The projection uses the ``observeWindowSeconds`` window even when KPA is in panic mode. The panic window stays a reactive signal, and the projection is deliberately the slower of the two."
msgstr "即使 KPA 处于 panic 模式，预测仍使用 ``observeWindowSeconds`` 窗口。panic 窗口仍作为响应式信号，而预测窗口会特意保持为两者中较慢的一个。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/autoscaling/predictive-autoscaling.rst:93
msgid "The projection is linear. Traffic with a strong daily shape still benefits from ``schedules``, which set bounds rather than a trend."
msgstr "预测采用线性模型。对于具有明显日周期的流量，仍适合使用 ``schedules``；它设置的是边界，而不是趋势。"
